        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539970/extras/43ee78fe7804c9c2497c73a4ef654939.avif?t=1767130196\" width=844 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a friendly and minimalist dungeon crawler experience where the player choose an adventurer who will try to discover the secret of an ancient tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill ?</strong> In this fast paced turn by turn rogue like, the rules are simple. Move your card on another one when you are ready and try to reach the next floor...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surprise ?</strong> Enter special rooms who can help you to go farther in the dungeon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danger ?</strong> You will face monsters and traps so take care or you will die :(</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One more try ?</strong> Each run will be different with the random spawning card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No time for long story ?</strong> the game clearly focus on gameplay with a minimalist story / lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For all ?</strong> No violence in Super Smling Dungeon : mostly all monsters are smiling and now...you understand the title of the game !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features :</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique playable characters with some who need to be unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty option : normal mode for all and hard mode to unlock for skilled players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special unique skill by hero </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 60 differents enemis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special rooms and side boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 Steam achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial : game mechanics can be learned in less than 5 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Languages : English / French / Spanish / Italian</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special :</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro design with mainly black &amp; white colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handmade pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running on all PC</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny price : support solo indie dev easily !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game releases following a successfully Kickstarter campaign to get the game on Steam ! :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539970/extras/43ee78fe7804c9c2497c73a4ef654939.avif?t=1767130196\" width=844 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a friendly and minimalist dungeon crawler experience where the player choose an adventurer who will try to discover the secret of an ancient tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill ?</strong> In this fast paced turn by turn rogue like, the rules are simple. Move your card on another one when you are ready and try to reach the next floor...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surprise ?</strong> Enter special rooms who can help you to go farther in the dungeon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danger ?</strong> You will face monsters and traps so take care or you will die :(</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One more try ?</strong> Each run will be different with the random spawning card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No time for long story ?</strong> the game clearly focus on gameplay with a minimalist story / lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For all ?</strong> No violence in Super Smling Dungeon : mostly all monsters are smiling and now...you understand the title of the game !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features :</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique playable characters with some who need to be unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty option : normal mode for all and hard mode to unlock for skilled players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special unique skill by hero </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 60 differents enemis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special rooms and side boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 Steam achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial : game mechanics can be learned in less than 5 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Languages : English / French / Spanish / Italian</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special :</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro design with mainly black &amp; white colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handmade pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running on all PC</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny price : support solo indie dev easily !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game releases following a successfully Kickstarter campaign to get the game on Steam ! :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Welcome to Super Smiling dungeon : the tiny and retro dungeon crawler. Train yourself to always go farther and unlock new heroes. Behind the portal, each run will be different with special rooms and some procedural generation available on each floor. Can you reach the top of the dungeon ?",
